        {
          "text": " Kama vile jeshi la mbinguni haliwezi kuhesabiwa, wala mchanga wa bahari kupimwa; ndivyo nitakavyoongeza wazao wa Daudi, mtumishi wangu, na Walawi wanaonihudumia. ",
